<title>FINLAND: SPONSOR 4-MTH PRE-TAX PROFIT RISES TO FIM 77.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>SPONSOR 4-MTH PRE-TAX PROFIT RISES TO FIM 77.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish venture capital company Sponsor Oy, fully owned by banking group Merita Oy , said on Thursday its pre-tax profit rose to 77.1 million markka from 22.3 million.  </p>
<p>Four months to end-April</p>
<p>(million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after financial items		  78.9 vs 26.9</p>
<p> Net sales					  310.1 vs 356.3</p>
<p> Operating profit				  72.5 vs 30.0</p>
<p> Net financial items			 gain 6.4 vs 3.1 charge</p>
<p> Minorities				  charge 1.8 vs 4.6 charge</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    77.1 vs 22.3</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    75.0 vs 65.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Sponsor Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 0 680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
